---
/** Primary lockup: symbol + two-tone wordmark (warm white / signal moss). */
---

<a href="/" class="rg-site-title">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 96 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="rg-mark">
    <path
      d="M40 24 C32 10.5 10 10.5 10 24 C10 37.5 32 37.5 40 24 C50 6.5 86 6.5 86 24 C86 41.5 50 41.5 40 24"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="5"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
    <path
      d="M56 31.5 C66 32 74 28.5 74 24"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="5"
      stroke-linecap="round"></path>
  </svg>
  <span class="rg-word">ripplegraph<span class="rg-ai">.ai</span></span>
</a>

<style>
  .rg-site-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .rg-mark {
    height: 1.375rem;
    width: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .rg-word {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .rg-ai {
    color: var(--rg-moss);
  }
</style>
